# KPI Starter structure

Keep modular boundaries so new work does not re-bloat route modules / inline DEMO.

## Layout

```
main.py                    # entry only: `uvicorn main:app` (run.sh)
sitekpi/
  app.py                   # FastAPI app, session middleware, static, routers
  routes/pages.py          # /, /{slug}, /live, /builder, /settings
  routes/connect.py        # /connect* — OAuth (PKCE), property, 業界パック pick
  ga4/oauth.py             # OAuth config, session creds, property list, preview
  ga4/data.py              # GA4 Data API → board overlay / builder widgets
  board/data.py            # build_dense_board: pack + data → board rows
  views/board.py           # dense board HTML/CSS/JS
  views/layout.py          # shared rail nav + mobile drawer (all pages)
  views/{home,builder,settings,connect,branding}.py
  packs/  i18n/  metrics/  # industry packs, l10n, shared 説明
static/  brand/  scripts/
```

## Where things go

| Change | Put it here | Do not |
|--------|-------------|--------|
| New industry pack | `sitekpi/packs/{slug}.py` + append to `PACK_MODULES` in `sitekpi/packs/registry.py` | Inline DEMO/BENCHMARKS in routes / `board/data.py` |
| Pack spoken labels (en/ko) | `sitekpi/i18n/pack_l10n.py` entry for that slug | Hardcode only-JP in board templates |
| UI chrome strings | `sitekpi/i18n/strings.py` | Scatter literals across HTML builders |
| Shared KPI 説明 | `sitekpi/metrics/help.py` | Duplicate long help per pack |
| Sample nav category | `sitekpi/packs/catalog.py` + `cat.*` in `sitekpi/i18n/strings.py` | Ad-hoc category strings in rail HTML |
| Board layout / board CSS | `sitekpi/views/board.py` / `sitekpi/board/data.py` | Per-industry alternate board UIs |
| Rail nav markup | `_rail_nav_html` in `sitekpi/views/layout.py` | Fork a second sample nav / top nav |
| New page / route | handler in `sitekpi/routes/*`, HTML in `sitekpi/views/*` | HTML inside route modules |
| GA4 API calls | `sitekpi/ga4/*` | Google client calls from views |

## Request state (multi-user)

- Per-user state lives in `request.session` only (server-side, encrypted — `sitekpi/session.py`).
- Never keep per-request values in module globals (`global X`); use arguments or a `ContextVar`
  (see `_ACTIVE_BENCH` in `views/board.py`). Process-wide caches must be bounded + locked (`sitekpi/cache.py`).
- Never write user choices to files in the repo.

## Pack checklist (new slug)

1. `sitekpi/packs/{slug}.py` with `PACK` (`meta.category`, benchmarks, demo, copy, event_desc)
2. `PACK_MODULES` in `sitekpi/packs/registry.py`
3. `PACK_L10N[slug]` with at least `label` / `hint` for `ja` / `en` / `ko`
4. Run `python scripts/smoke_packs.py`

## Rail / app chrome

Rail markup, CSS, the mobile drawer and its JS live only in `sitekpi/views/layout.py`
(`rail_css()`, `rail_html()`, `mobile_bar_html()`, `rail_js()`; nav context from
`sitekpi/routes/nav.py`). Every page uses them — never re-declare `.rail` styles in a page.
`scripts/smoke_packs.py` fails if rail CSS is duplicated.

## Product frame (do not reopen lightly)

Same dense board for every pack; samples ≠ live; connect applies 業界目安 only. Details: `kpi-starter-ux` rule.
